  "description_html": "Ankalar's FN F2000 for HL/Sven 9mmAR\r\n=====================================\r\n\r\nHere comes the poly-waste-monster!\r\nJust kidding, I removed some unnecessary polys in the view model,\r\nso it shouldn't make your computer lagging too much.\r\n\r\nCredits:\r\n--------\r\nModel: Ankalar\r\nUV-maps: Ankalar\r\nSkin: Ankalar, Thanez, Numbrider\r\nM16 Magazine Dark Skin: Stoke\r\n\r\nCartridge in Magazine: -X-\r\n\r\nImproved HEV/OP4/BS Arm Models: Ambient.Impact\r\nHEV Arm Textures: H4wK\r\nOP4 Hatch Glove Texture: Tackleberry\r\nOP4 Arm Texture: Millenia\r\nRemapping Textures to Gearbox UV: Toadie\r\nBS Arm Textures: H4wK\r\n\r\nAnimations: Toadie\r\nShooting Sound: Toadie\r\nGrenade Launcher Sound: from M203 in Firearms Mod 3.0\r\nReloading Sound: ??? Please contact me if you know who made this.\r\nMuzzleflash Sprite: from CS 1.6\r\n\r\n+----------------------------------------------------+\r\n| Compile/Convert/Hacks/Tweaks: NovaRain (aka N.R.)  |\r\n+----------------------------------------------------+",
